ING POLICY"),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](9,"p"),i["\u0275\u0275text"](10,"Links to external websites/portals"),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](11,"p"),i["\u0275\u0275text"](12,"We don't mind linking directly to the information hosted on your site and no prior permission is required for this. However, we ask that you notify us of any links provided on our site so that you can be informed of any changes or updates therein. Also, we do not allow our pages to be loaded into frames on your site. The pages of our website should load in the user's newly opened browser window."),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](13,"h4",5),i["\u0275\u0275text"](14,"COPYRIGHT POLICY"),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](15,"p"),i["\u0275\u0275text"](16,"The material displayed on this portal may be reproduced free of charge after taking proper permission by sending a mail to us. However, the material must be reproduced accurately and must not be used in a derogatory manner or in a misleading context. Wherever the material is being published or released to others, the source should be prominently acknowledged. Although,Permission to reproduce this material shall not extend to any material that is identified to be the copyright of a third party. Authorization to reproduce such material should be obtained from the concerned departments/copyright holders."),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](17,"p"),i["\u0275\u0275text"](18,"These Terms and Conditions shall be governed by and applicable in accordance with the Indian laws. Any dispute arising under these terms and conditions shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in India."),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](19,"h4",5),i["\u0275\u0275text"](20,"PRIVACY POLICY"),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](21,"p"),i["\u0275\u0275text"](22,"The ORGI website does not automatically collect any specific personal information (such as name, phone number or e-mail address) from you that allows us to identify you personally."),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](23,"p"),i["\u0275\u0275text"](24,"If the ORGI website requests you to provide personal information, you will be notified of the specific purposes for which the information is collected and adequate security measures will be taken to protect your personal information."),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](25,"p"),i["\u0275\u0275text"](26,"We do not voluntarily sell or share any personally identifiable information on the ORGI website to any third party (public/private). Any information provided to this website will be protected from loss, misuse, unauthorized access or disclosure, alteration, or destruction."),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](27,"p"),i["\u0275\u0275text"](28,"We collect certain information about the user, such as Internet Protocol (IP) addresses, domain name, browser type, operating system, date and time of visit and pages visited. We make no effort to link these addresses to the identities of individuals who visit our sites unless there is an attempt to damage the site."),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"]())},directives:[p.a],styles:[""]}),e})(),Zg=(()=>{class e{constructor(){}ngOnInit(){}}return e.\u0275fac=function(t){return new(t||e)},e.\u0275cmp=i["\u0275\u0275defineComponent"]({type:e,selectors:[["app-mobile-app-policy"]],decls:55,vars:0,consts:[[1,"container","mt-3","mb-4"],[1,"row"],[1,"col"],[1,"border-top","border-4","border-primary","px-4"],[1,"policy-subtitle","mb-2"],[1,"list-bullets"],[1,"mb-2"]],template:function(e,t){1&e&&(i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](0,"section"),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](1,"div",0),i["\u0275\u027