trar of Births and Deaths, and you authorize us to charge your debit or credit card or process other available means of payment for those fee. The ORGI works with third-party payment processing partners to offer you the most convenient payment methods and to keep your payment information secure. Check out our Privacy Policy for more details. "),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](8,"p"),i["\u0275\u0275text"](9,"The informants / parents are therefore requested to review the details of the child at the time of birth reporting and of deceased at the time of death reporting so that the birth / death certificate(s) could be issued error free after registration of the event. The amount of fee/fine once paid, is not refundable/transferrable under any circumstances (except to the applicant who might have ended up in paying fee more than once due to any technical issue with the server of the bank/ payment gateway concerned. However, such refund would be made only after ascertaining the actual receipt of payment of prescribed service more than once, which would be possible only after reconciliation of collected fee data as received from the banks concerned with the fee data recorded in the server) even in case of cancellation / rejection of an application by the respective registering authority."),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"](),i["\u0275\u0275elementEnd"]())},directives:[p.a],styles:[""]}),e})(),o_=(()=>{class e{constructor(){}ngOnInit(){}}return e.\u0275fac=function(t){return new(t||e)},e.\u0275cmp=i["\u0275\u0275defineComponent"]({type:e,selectors:[["app-grievance-management"]],decls:18,vars:0,consts:[[1,"container","mt-3","mb-4"],[1,"row"],[1,"col"],[1,"border-top","border-4","border-primary","px-4"],[1,"mb-2"],["type","i"]],template:function(e,t){1&e&&(i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](0,"div",0),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"](1,"div",1),i["\u0275\u0275elementStart"